  Occupation: Student
  CharacterDescription: Young, nervous, avoids eye contact
  CharacterArc: Young and perpetually anxious, Luka started university with bright
    hopes and a full scholarship. As the radiation crept in and the campus emptied,
    his anxiety curdled into a quiet dread he never learned to voice. He isn't brave
    enough to be reckless and not resigned enough to be calm, leaving him trapped
    in a flickering middle ground of small, desperate routines.
  DateOfBirth: 11/04/1982
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 30 OCT
